{"product_id":"super-hybrid-chalk","title":"SUPER HybRid CHALK","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEnhanced Grip. Wider Contact. Cleaner Play.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSUPER HybRid CHALK\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is an advanced Japanese billiard chalk developed in collaboration with professional players \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLo Li-Wen\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e and \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSatoshi Kawabata\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Evolved from the original HybRid CHALK, its formula was completely reconsidered and refined to deliver enhanced grip, improved miscue resistance, and a more balanced chalking experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe refined formulation provides a \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eslightly more moist and comfortable feel\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e compared with traditional dry chalk while maintaining controlled application. This balanced character gives players greater confidence when approaching demanding contact points, including shots played close to the edge or lower areas of the cue ball.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhy Choose SUPER HybRid?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEnhanced Grip\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Provides strong tip-to-ball friction for confident cue-ball control\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWider Effective Contact\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Helps maintain grip when striking closer to the edge of the cue ball\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExcellent Miscue Resistance\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Designed to provide greater confidence on demanding contact points\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBalanced Chalking Feel\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Sits between traditional dry chalk and very moist formulas\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSmooth Application\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Provides a comfortable and controlled feel when applying chalk to the tip\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLow Chalk Transfer\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Designed to minimize unwanted marks on the cue ball, cloth, and hand\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLonger Lasting\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Developed to wear more slowly than the original HybRid CHALK\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eProfessional Development\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Developed together with professional players Lo Li-Wen and Satoshi Kawabata\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMade in Japan\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Premium Japanese billiard chalk\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe SUPER HybRid Advantage\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMore Grip\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e gives you greater confidence when pushing the limits of cue-ball control.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWider Contact\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e helps maintain reliable tip-to-ball friction when playing extreme English or contacting lower and outer areas of the cue ball.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBalanced Moisture\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e provides a comfortable chalking feel without becoming excessively sticky or dry.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLow Transfer\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e helps keep the cue ball, cloth, and playing hand cleaner during play.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAvailable Colors\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBlue • Green • Purple\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePerfect For\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePlayers looking for a premium Japanese billiard chalk that combines \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eenhanced grip, excellent miscue resistance, a balanced chalking feel, low transfer, and long-lasting performance\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSUPER HybRid CHALK — Enhanced Grip. Wider Contact. Cleaner Play.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 🎱\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43489138671664,"sku":null,"price":1300.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/5f103c2b-557c-4f93-aefe-6b500558b8ad.png?v=1786762507","url":"https:\/\/www.el